  "attributes": [],
  "category": {
    "name": "sandwich-ingredients",
    "url": "/api/v2/item-category/53/"
  },
  "effect_entries": [],
  "flavor_text_entries": [
    {
      "text": "文献でのみ　伝わる　幻の調味料。その甘みを　口にすると　胃が活性化し食欲不振が　完治するという　逸話がある。",
      "version_group": {
        "name": "scarlet-violet",
        "url": "/api/v2/version-group/25/"
      },
      "language": {
        "name": "ja-hrkt",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/1/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "문헌으로만 전해 내려오는 환상의 조미료. 그 단맛을 한번 맛보면 위가 활성화되어 식욕 부진이 완치된다는 이야기가 있다.",
      "version_group": {
        "name": "scarlet-violet",
        "url": "/api/v2/version-group/25/"
      },
      "language": {
        "name": "ko",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/3/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "僅在文獻中流傳的幻之調味料。根據某段軼聞，有人嚐其甘甜之後，腸胃開始活化，食慾不振的困擾也迎刃而解。",
      "version_group": {
        "name": "scarlet-violet",
        "url": "/api/v2/version-group/25/"
      },
      "language": {
        "name": "zh-hant",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/4/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "Un condiment dont seules les fables conservent la trace. Sa douceur est telle qu’une pincée suffit pour stimuler la digestion et soigner le manque d’appétit le plus tenace.",
      "version_group": {
        "name": "scarlet-violet",
        "url": "/api/v2/version-group/25/"
      },
      "language": {
        "name": "fr",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/5/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "Ein mystisches Würzmittel, das nur aus alten Texten bekannt ist. Sein süßer Geschmack soll angeblich die Verdauung anregen und so Appetitlosigkeit kurieren.",
      "version_group": {
        "name": "scarlet-violet",
        "url": "/api/v2/version-group/25/"
      },
      "language": {
        "name": "de",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/6/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "Un misterioso condimento legendario del que solo se habla en libros. Su dulzor estimula el sistema digestivo y devuelve el apetito a cualquiera.",
      "version_group": {
        "name": "scarlet-violet",
        "url": "/api/v2/version-group/25/"
      },
      "language": {
        "name": "es",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/7/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "Un condimento leggendario di cui si narra solo nei libri. Sembra che la sua dolcezza stimoli lo stomaco e curi la mancanza di appetito.",
      "version_group": {
        "name": "scarlet-violet",
        "url": "/api/v2/version-group/25/"
      },
      "language": {
        "name": "it",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/8/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "A legendary condiment told of only in books. Word has it that one taste of its sweet flavor stimulates the digestive system and cures a lack of appetite.",
      "version_group": {
        "name": "scarlet-violet",
        "url": "/api/v2/version-group/25/"
      },
      "language": {
        "name": "en",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/9/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "文献でのみ　伝わる　幻の調味料。その甘みを　口にすると　胃が活性化し食欲不振が　完治するという　逸話がある。",
      "version_group": {
        "name": "scarlet-violet",
        "url": "/api/v2/version-group/25/"
      },
      "language": {
        "name": "ja",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/11/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "仅出现在文献中的奇幻调味料。更有称品尝过其甜味之后胃被激活，食欲不振得到根治的轶事。",
      "version_group": {
        "name": "scarlet-violet",
        "url": "/api/v2/version-group/25/"
      },
      "language": {
